U+FE0F only).\"},\n {\"id\":\"mixed-escape-soup\",\"concept\":\"every character in a randomly chosen notation (U+004E, \\\\u0069, &#99;, &#x65;, %20, \\\\x77, 0x6f, \\\\162, named entities)\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"Likely Time Trial / Mastery MUTATION of the D7/D8/D9/D25 codecs ('new unseen effects'). One alternation tokenizer over URL %xx, %uXXXX, HTML &#N; &#xH; &name;, \\\\uXXXX, \\\\UXXXXXXXX, \\\\u{..}, \\\\xNN, \\\\NNN octal, U+XXXX, 0xNN; whole text must tokenise (allow single separators); per-token radix. Prefer stdlib (html.unescape, unquote) only after splitting. Fixtures: uniform random mixtures, per-word notation, with and without separators; decoys: single-notation blobs (must give the same text).\"},\n {\"id\":\"delta-encoded-codepoints\",\"concept\":\"delta / chained code points: first absolute then signed differences, running XOR, cumulative sums\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"'Point to point' re-read. Integer token lists (decimal, signed, or U+/hex) whose values are mostly small and signed: try cumulative sum, XOR scan (c_i = v_i ^ c_{i-1}), and the reverse direction; chr; crib-gated (must START 'Nice work'). Fixtures: signed decimal deltas, hex deltas mod 256 / mod 0x110000, XOR chain hex, decoys (plain decimal char codes must not be re-summed).\"},\n {\"id\":\"utf8-bytes-mojibake\",\"concept\":\"UTF-8 bytes vs code points: mojibake (UTF-8 read as cp1252/latin-1, double-encoded), byte escapes of multibyte sequences\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"'Encoding confusion' sibling of D19-D20 and D25. Detect Ã/Â/ï¼/â€ runs; repair by t.encode('cp1252' or 'latin-1', errors='strict').decode('utf-8') repeated up to 3 times; then NFKC and the normal pipeline (fullwidth text survives as ASCII). Also `\\\\xef\\\\xbc\\\\xae` / `%EF%BC%AE` byte escapes -> bytes -> utf-8. ftfy not installed -- stdlib only. Fixtures: single/double mojibake of fullwidth and of plain text with smart quotes, cp1